> 
> ..DPRINTK() & VPRINTK() calls.
> 
> Also please see comments below (from v1 review).
> 
>> Signed-off-by: Hannes Reinecke <hare@suse.de>
>> ---
>>  drivers/ata/libata-core.c     |  5 +++
